{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  MyFrequentRewards — lifecycle email system v6
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 13. Birthday greeting
  File       : birthday.liquid
  Class      : Engagement (marketing — unsubscribe required)
  Trigger    : Member’s birthday
  Tone       : welcome
  Replaces   : birthday.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Happy birthday, {{ user.name.first }}
    2. A birthday wish from everyone at MyFrequentRewards
    3. Wishing you a wonderful day, {{ user.name.first }}

  PREHEADER
    No survey, no ask — just a good wish from the panel team.

  PRIMARY CTA
    none — this template asks for nothing

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/birthday.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/13-birthday.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
